quickAnswer: "To find your exact age, enter your birth date and target calculation date. The calculator computes full completed years, months, and days using strict UTC calendar math to avoid daylight saving shifts. You also receive total hours, days, weeks, elapsed lifetime, and an automatic countdown to your next birthday celebration."
formula:
  title: "Exact Age Calculation Method"
  expression: "Exact Age = Target Date (YYYY-MM-DD) - Date of Birth (YYYY-MM-DD)"
  explanation: "Age is determined by subtracting the birth year, month, and day from the target date. If the target day is less than the birth day, days are borrowed from the preceding calendar month based on that month's exact length (28 to 31 days). In common years, leap day (February 29) birthdays can be evaluated under March 1 or February 28 conventions."
workedExamples:
